# Local overrides. .env itself IS committed: the only thing in it is the
# Spotify Client ID, which is a public identifier — it is inlined into the
# bundle at build time and readable by anyone who opens the deployed game.
# That is exactly why the game authenticates with PKCE instead of a secret.
# Anything that genuinely must not be shared goes in .env.local.
.env.local
.env.*.local
